---
config:
  theme: default
description: every style key v12 reads on a set (fill, fill-opacity, stroke, stroke-width with a unit, color), an overlap's fill and color, and a text node's color, with hex and rgb() values
---
venn-beta
  set A["Styled set"]
  set B["Plain set"]
  union A, B["Styled overlap"]
    text note
  style A fill:#ff6b6b, fill-opacity:0.4, stroke:rgb(120, 20, 20), stroke-width:4px, color:#5a0000
  style A,B fill:#ffe66d, color:#333333
  style note color:#0b5394
